<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ocko-termite-mound-convective-chimneys-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "King, Ocko & Mahadevan (2015) PNAS, Ocko et al. (2017) PNAS & Ocko, Heyde & Mahadevan (2019) PNAS solar-powered diurnal thermosiphon ventilation and convective pheromone morphogenesis of cathedral termite mounds — Model fidelity to source: 58/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements algebraic formulas for Boussinesq thermosiphon velocity, convective Péclet aspect ratio scaling, and Taylor–Aris CO₂ dispersion (L34-74), backed by 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_097_termite_mound_convective_chimneys.lean`. However, it does not integrate the coupled 24-hour diurnal solar-thermal ODE/PDE for flute-chimney temperature and nest CO₂ clearance or the Ocko et al. (2019) moving-boundary pheromone advection-diffusion-deposition solver." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2015-ocko-termite-mound-convective-chimneys.py L77–L96: Evaluates static table lookup rather than solving coupled diurnal thermal-CO2 and moving-boundary pheromone PDEs <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/e93f00e/2015-ocko-termite-mound-convective-chimneys.py#L77-L96>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ocko-termite-mound-convective-chimneys-model-fidelity-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 5.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ocko-termite-mound-convective-chimneys-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "King, Ocko & Mahadevan (2015) PNAS, Ocko et al. (2017) PNAS & Ocko, Heyde & Mahadevan (2019) PNAS solar-powered diurnal thermosiphon ventilation and convective pheromone morphogenesis of cathedral termite mounds — Morphometric validation: 53/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L188-200) reports only 4 scalar values without Pearson r, p-value, RMSE, diurnal velocity and CO₂ correlations, convective Péclet `H/W` correlation, equatorward latitude tilt correlation, or empirical specimen CV silhouette metrics." ;
