        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ocko-termite-mound-convective-chimneys-measurement-midday-peak-exterior-flute-updraft-velocity-u-flute-dt-6-8-k>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ocko-termite-mound-convective-chimneys-measurement-wild-type-macrotermes-cathedral-mound-aspect-ratio-h-w-pe-3-2> ;
