    dct:description "Evaluates the 9-point diurnal temperature table (L77-96), but omits the 7-point convective Péclet morphogenesis sweep `Pe in [0.0, 4.2]`, omits the 6-point geographic latitude equatorward spire tilt sweep `|phi_lat| in [0.0, 24.0] deg S`, omits the *Macrotermes* vs *Odontotermes* vs shaded isothermal dome controls, and exposes no CLI parameter overrides." ;
