    pk:hypothesisType "Coupled Diurnal Buoyancy Thermosiphon Flow Q_flute = -Q_chimney ∝ g β_T (T_flute - T_chimney) + Advection–Diffusion of Cement Pheromone / CO₂ (∂_t c + u · ∇c = D ∇²c - γ c) & Threshold Soil Deposition Sculpting Cathedral Spires, Surface Flutes, and Central Chimney" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_097.effective_co2_dispersion" ;
